{
  "post": {
    "id": "13130129",
    "published": "2017-04-26T07:40:16.000Z",
    "title": "(°▽°)どやっ",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13130129.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170429092327/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13130129.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "無性に食べたくなって買っちゃった！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "突然特别想吃，就买啦！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I suddenly got a craving for it and bought some!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_100APPLE_IMG_0405.JPG",
            "media": "4d9f2bea400b.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h14jTAIoRbhtXLUCD_ZURTBVwaHQuTnQTPVV5ISJ7ZDUiQXkbP1d7LS1zLGx7e3AWIBxTDjlTbGsTbU0ZMTVGNTVabC8YS2tNLBd5YXIoOCl6GCFKbUMhdSctNiJ9GmxMbElyLyZ4Zw"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ホットケーキはみんな何をかけて食べる派ですか？よかったら教えてください\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "8ca24e2a3a95.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00093.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家吃热香饼都喜欢淋什么呀？方便的话告诉我吧"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What do you all like to put on your hotcakes? Please tell me if you don't mind"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "a71b65410e5f.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00111.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "Ke2d_ozTEF.jpg",
            "media": "22924f7a24c7.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hTsXECyUTC1xlPCXEwX90CydhDTMcXxFUD0QcZhBqAXIQUBxcDUYeah9iSRI6DktVEikBPEJ7HmQ1Wyh5BCwMQQJICDsBXjV1IyIbJkA5XW5ICUQCX1lEMhI0VWRJCQkLXlgXb0E9UA"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ちなみに肝心のホットケーキの写真ですが、いい色に焼けたのが嬉しくて近くから撮りすぎてしまった…笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "顺便说一下，那张关键的热香饼照片——因为烤出漂亮的颜色太开心了，结果凑得太近拍过头了……笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By the way, about the photo of the hotcake itself, which is the whole point: I was so happy that it browned to such a nice color that I took it from way too close... lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "次はパンケーキ屋さんのパンケーキみたいに分厚く焼いてみたいなあ。ちょっと贅沢してフルーツとか乗せるのもいいかも！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "下次想试着烤成像松饼店那样的厚松饼。稍微奢侈一下，铺点水果在上面说不定也不错！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Next time I want to bake them thick like the pancakes at a pancake shop. Maybe I'll treat myself a little and put some fruit on top too!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そういえば、LINEの自動返信をみんなの意見を参考にしつつちょっとだけ増やしてみました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "对了，参考大家的意见，我给LINE的自动回复稍微增加了一些内容。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Also, I added a few more LINE auto-replies, using everyone's opinions as a reference."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "まだまだ少しずつ増やしていく予定なのでお楽しみに〜(*'▽'*)♪"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "之后还打算一点点地继续增加，敬请期待～(*'▽'*)♪"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I plan to keep adding more little by little, so look forward to it~(*'▽'*)♪"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "(°▽°) 怎么样！",
    "titleEn": "(°▽°) Ta-da!"
  },
